## Context
Line counts on origin/main: gaze 951, raid 509, roar 422, review-pr about 350, verify-adherence about 320. Each is read in full per run. `zotero`, `slides` and `route` already use `references/` to load detail on demand. In gaze the title says "six-phase", the description names four steps, and it calls `/review`, which is not a skill.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] gaze, raid and roar split into a core of at most about 150 lines plus `references/` files read at the phase that needs them
- [ ] Behaviour unchanged: one gaze dry run on a merged PR and one roar dry run give the same verdict and artifacts as before
- [ ] gaze title, description and phase list agree; the `/review` mention is fixed or removed
- [ ] Blocked until 1100 reshapes gaze; raid and roar need not wait and may land first

